<title>UK: Masthead, Murray Lawrence drop merger plan.</title>
<headline>Masthead, Murray Lawrence drop merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Masthead Insurance Underwriting Plc and Murray Lawrence Holdings Limited said on Wednesday they had abandoned their merger plan as it failed to attract sufficient support from Masthead shareholders.</p>
</text>
